{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222250","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222250","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322225001:1":{"text":"ペンダント、名札……彼らの存在を証明する物がこんなに……","source_cn":"吊坠、名牌……好在还有这么多东西可以证明他们的存在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EF74F14A7309F31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322225002:1":{"text":"名前はかすれて見えませんが、家族が見たら分かるかもしれません。","source_cn":"虽然已经看不清名字了，但说不定还有能认出它们的家人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F8A66CF02E5359E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322225003:1":{"text":"勲章を持ち歩いている人もいます。立派な戦功をあげた証拠ですね！","source_cn":"甚至还有人随身带着勋章，证明着他们曾经的赫赫战功！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B662C1931F2ADB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322225004:1":{"text":"この勲章……戦死した後も胸元にずっとつけていたということは、きっと大事な物だったんでしょうね。","source_cn":"这枚勋章在战死后都还贴在他的心口，一定是极为看重的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF12D8120FB69C44C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322225005:1":{"text":"これらの証拠をカレリーナさんに持って行ってあげましょう！","source_cn":"我们快把这些证据带回给卡列琳娜吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02D8123355FF095E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu